    },
    {
      "id": 15038,
      "start": 95,
      "end": 97,
      "text": "就變成給政府",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15039,
      "start": 97,
      "end": 102,
      "text": "剛剛有個期就問我哋想想怎樣做",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15040,
      "start": 102,
      "end": 106,
      "text": "有啲人給了一些創業出來",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15041,
      "start": 106,
      "end": 111,
      "text": "喺外國好多嗰陣時都會用一些好大的恆温dorm",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15042,
      "start": 111,
      "end": 115.16,
      "text": "建立後就被人坐",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15043,
      "start": 115.16,
      "end": 117.8,
      "text": "所以變成一個dorm的尺寸就唔能夠太大",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15044,
      "start": 117.8,
      "end": 121.24,
      "text": "只能夠為了一千人左右就變成一塊",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15045,
      "start": 121.24,
      "end": 123,
      "text": "變成舞台中間嗰陣時",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15046,
      "start": 123,
      "end": 129,
      "text": "如果你要做3D mapping和Fisual有關的嘢",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15047,
      "start": 129,
      "end": 131.48,
      "text": "其實人太多你也係做不到的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15048,
      "start": 131.48,
      "end": 134.6,
      "text": "例如紅館你不可以喺旁邊間隔位置",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15049,
      "start": 134.6,
      "end": 135.96,
      "text": "隔位置給人睇嘢",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15050,
      "start": 135.96,
      "end": 139.64,
      "text": "剛剛喺呢個設計裏做了我哋想做的一個",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15051,
      "start": 139.64,
      "end": 143.1,
      "text": "唔使戴眼鏡的3D效果",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15052,
      "start": 143.1,
      "end": 146.78,
      "text": "還有有稀味的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15053,
      "start": 146.78,
      "end": 149.84,
      "text": "主題叫做4D",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15054,
      "start": 149.84,
      "end": 152.48,
      "text": "聽説場館分成四拍",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15055,
      "start": 152.48,
      "end": 155.78,
      "text": "以Leon的LEON四個唔同主題",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15056,
      "start": 155.78,
      "end": 159.12,
      "text": "例如有Love、激情、Night Horror",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15057,
      "start": 159.12,
      "end": 162.96,
      "text": "大家也期待有乜嘢係",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15058,
      "start": 162.96,
      "end": 165.96,
      "text": "演唱會就算係四面台",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15059,
      "start": 165.96,
      "end": 167.36,
      "text": "你也係同一個Leon",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15060,
      "start": 167.36,
      "end": 169.76,
      "text": "那四個主題究竟係可以怎樣玩",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15061,
      "start": 169.76,
      "end": 171.36,
      "text": "其實大家都好興奮",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15062,
      "start": 171.36,
      "end": 176.16,
      "text": "呢個Facebook係否你自己會上傳一些嘢",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15063,
      "start": 176.16,
      "end": 178.16,
      "text": "或係你外面唔係説話",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15064,
      "start": 178.16,
      "end": 179.76,
      "text": "有好多助理喺嗰度",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15065,
      "start": 179.76,
      "end": 181.76,
      "text": "係否佢哋幫你 或係你自己做的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15066,
      "start": 181.76,
      "end": 183.76,
      "text": "通常的素材係我放上去的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15067,
      "start": 183.76,
      "end": 185.76,
      "text": "素材係我自己想的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15068,
      "start": 185.76,
      "end": 187.76,
      "text": "好少人會幫我",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15069,
      "start": 187.76,
      "end": 189.36,
      "text": "因為想完之後未必係你的嘢",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15070,
      "start": 189.36,
      "end": 193.2,
      "text": "為何等到今時今日才可以開呢個Facebook的項目",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15071,
      "start": 193.2,
      "end": 195.36,
      "text": "呢個世界上有啲人反應好快",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15072,
      "start": 195.36,
      "end": 196.84,
      "text": "有啲人反應好慢",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15073,
      "start": 196.84,
      "end": 198.84,
      "text": "我就屬於最慢的嗰一種",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15074,
      "start": 198.84,
      "end": 200.84,
      "text": "我今日代到第一句金句",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15075,
      "start": 200.84,
      "end": 202.68,
      "text": "好開心",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15076,
      "start": 202.68,
      "end": 205.24,
      "text": "而家呢個人對音樂",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15077,
      "start": 205.24,
      "end": 207.72,
      "text": "係唔係還有那股熱情喺這裏",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15078,
      "start": 207.72,
      "end": 209.56,
      "text": "我對音樂一向都有熱情",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15079,
      "start": 209.56,
      "end": 211.44,
      "text": "你好鍾意音樂",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15080,
      "start": 211.44,
      "end": 213.44,
      "text": "音樂的過程裏",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15081,
      "start": 213.44,
      "end": 215.84,
      "text": "而家係好多嗰陣時喺香港樂壇裏",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15082,
      "start": 215.84,
      "end": 217.16,
      "text": "我直説我的感受",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15083,
      "start": 217.16,
      "end": 219.24,
      "text": "但可能對其他人會不公平",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15084,
      "start": 219.24,
      "end": 221.24,
      "text": "其實自己後輪根本冇著火",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15085,
      "start": 221.24,
      "end": 223.24,
      "text": "但覺得自己後輪著火",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15086,
      "start": 223.24,
      "end": 226.24,
      "text": "人家叫做事時就想著自己後輪",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15087,
      "start": 226.24,
      "end": 229.24,
      "text": "變成做事時好難專注",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15088,
      "start": 229.24,
      "end": 233.24,
      "text": "有時做事靈感和集中度",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15089,
      "start": 233.24,
      "end": 235.24,
      "text": "其實只係集中四天搞定",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15090,
      "start": 235.24,
      "end": 237.24,
      "text": "但你整個人都覺得後輪著火",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15091,
      "start": 237.24,
      "end": 239.24,
      "text": "嗰度少了一隻羊、少了一隻牛",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15092,
      "start": 239.24,
      "end": 241.24,
      "text": "你好難專注到做事",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15093,
      "start": 241.24,
      "end": 243.24,
      "text": "有冇新歌？",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15094,
      "start": 243.24,
      "end": 245.24,
      "text": "我想新歌都會有啲",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15095,
      "start": 245.24,
      "end": 247.24,
      "text": "但如果而家做新歌就冇咗",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15096,
      "start": 247.24,
      "end": 252.24,
      "text": "你自己得不得閒呢",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15097,
      "start": 252.24,
      "end": 255.24,
      "text": "我有好聽的歌 我根本三個小時不用錄咗",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15098,
      "start": 255.24,
      "end": 258.24,
      "text": "以我今日的促藝",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15099,
      "start": 258.24,
      "end": 262.24,
      "text": "我冇退步 我計算有進步",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15100,
      "start": 262.24,
      "end": 263.24,
      "text": "我唱K",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15101,
      "start": 263.24,
      "end": 266.24,
      "text": "你一叫他 他立刻畀你吧",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15102,
      "start": 266.24,
      "end": 268.24,
      "text": "嗰啲填詞人 我想也係三個小時之內",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15103,
      "start": 268.24,
      "end": 270.24,
      "text": "林夕係消失的",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15104,
      "start": 270.24,
      "end": 271.24,
      "text": "聽我的電話",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15105,
      "start": 271.24,
      "end": 273.24,
      "text": "消失的填詞人",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15106,
      "start": 273.24,
      "end": 274.24,
      "text": "唔係消失的我人",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15107,
      "start": 274.24,
      "end": 275.52,
      "text": "傑仁之人",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15108,
      "start": 275.52,
      "end": 277.32,
      "text": "雷仲德打麻雀就回覆",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15109,
      "start": 277.32,
      "end": 278.34,
      "text": "我的嗰啲不回覆",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15110,
      "start": 278.34,
      "end": 280.9,
      "text": "老實説 如果黎明鏗演唱會",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15111,
      "start": 280.9,
      "end": 283.46,
      "text": "我哋都希望聽好多舊嘅歌",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15112,
      "start": 283.46,
      "end": 286.52,
      "text": "你叫雷仲德寫新歌出來",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15113,
      "start": 286.52,
      "end": 287.8,
      "text": "我寫包單",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15114,
      "start": 287.8,
      "end": 289.34,
      "text": "你叫他寫完出來",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15115,
      "start": 289.34,
      "end": 290.88,
      "text": "大家投票咗",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15116,
      "start": 290.88,
      "end": 291.9,
      "text": "乜嘢事",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15117,
      "start": 291.9,
      "end": 292.92,
      "text": "投乜嘢事",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15118,
      "start": 292.92,
      "end": 294.46,
      "text": "終於舊還係新",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15119,
      "start": 294.46,
      "end": 296.76,
      "text": "意思應該都係",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15120,
      "start": 296.76,
      "end": 298.04,
      "text": "唔好搞新事咗",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15121,
      "start": 298.04,
      "end": 299.84,
      "text": "我也覺得係",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15122,
      "start": 299.84,
      "end": 301.88,
      "text": "有新事物一早就畀你",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15123,
      "start": 301.88,
      "end": 303.68,
      "text": "你唔會等你叫才給",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15124,
      "start": 303.68,
      "end": 308.44,
      "text": "你明白乜嘢 好多嗰陣時等你叫才讓老夫老車離婚",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15125,
      "start": 308.44,
      "end": 312.68,
      "text": "對 作歌人聽到咗 如果有好嘢",
      "translation": ""
